esetMana() entry point and CastDenied event, plus PlayerManaUI's denied-cast flash feedback, and added UnityEngine.UI to the test asmdef so the UI tests can compile. No production code was touched.\",\"claimed_changed_paths\":[\"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs\",\"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests.asmdef\"],\"test_cases_added_or_updated\":[\"ResetMana_RestoresCurrentManaToFull_AfterPartialSpend (AC-001)\",\"ResetMana_RestoresCurrentManaToFull_AfterManaFullySpent (AC-001)\",\"ResetMana_ClearsPostCastRegenDelayTimerState (AC-001, reflection on private timeSinceLastSpend field)\",\"Spend_RaisesCastDenied_WhenAmountExceedsCurrentMana (AC-002)\",\"Spend_DoesNotRaiseCastDenied_WhenSpendSucceeds (AC-002)\",\"Spend_ZeroOrNegativeAmount_DoesNotRaiseCastDenied (regression-only)\",\"PlayerManaUI_FlashesDeniedColor_OnCastDenied_ThenRevertsAfterDuration (VAL-002/VAL-003)\",\"PlayerManaUI_DoesNotFlash_OnSuccessfulSpend (regression-only)\",\"PlayerMana_PublicApiSurface_OnlyOwnsManaAndRegenDelayState (AC-003, regression-only ownership-boundary invariant)\"],\"blockers\":[],\"known_limitations\":[\"ResetMana_ClearsPostCastRegenDelayTimerState uses reflection on the private `timeSinceLastSpend` field because ResetMana always also sets CurrentMana to MaxMana, and Tick() short-circuits whenever CurrentMana >= MaxMana, so the timer-clearing half of AC-001 has no observable effect through the public Spend/Tick/CurrentMana surface alone; this mirrors the project's existing reflection-based private-member test pattern in the Editor test suite but is tied to the current field name.\",\"PlayerManaUI tests wire the private `mana`/`fillImage`/`deniedFlashDuration` serialized fields via reflection (no public setters exist) and toggle `enabled` off/on so OnEnable re-subscribes to CastDenied with the correct mana reference, since the initial AddComponent-triggered OnEnable runs before the fields are set.\",\"PlayerMana_PublicApiSurface_OnlyOwnsManaAndRegenDelayState (AC-003) is a regression-only public-surface lock; it cannot prove no private spell-local state was ever added to PlayerMana, only that its public contract has not grown to expose such state.\",\"No Unity Editor, compiler, or test runner was executed; compilation and pass/fail status are unverified by me and require an actual Unity Test Runner run plus human Play Mode/visual confirmation of the mana-denied flash readability.\"],\"proposed_unity_test_scope\":\"Run the Unity Test Runner in Play Mode against the NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests assembly (filter: NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests.PlayerManaPlayModeTests) on a clean working tree, capture the XML result (total/passed/failed/skipped), and recheck `git status`/`git diff` afterward to confirm the non-mutation invariant held; a human should also visually confirm in Play Mode that the mana bar's red flash on a denied Force Wave/Fireball cast reads clearly as low-mana failure feedback per GDD §3.\"}","structured_output":{"summary":"Extended Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs with Play Mode (and one pure reflection) tests covering NSC-005's new PlayerMana.ResetMana() entry point and CastDenied event, plus PlayerManaUI's denied-cast flash feedback, and added UnityEngine.UI to the test asmdef so the UI tests can compile. No production code was touched.","claimed_changed_paths":["Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs","Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests.asmdef"],"test_cases_added_or_updated":["ResetMana_RestoresCurrentManaToFull_AfterPartialSpend (AC-001)","ResetMana_RestoresCurrentManaToFull_AfterManaFullySpent (AC-001)","ResetMana_ClearsPostCastRegenDelayTimerState (AC-001, reflection on private timeSinceLastSpend field)","Spend_RaisesCastDenied_WhenAmountExceedsCurrentMana (AC-002)","Spend_DoesNotRaiseCastDenied_WhenSpendSucceeds (AC-002)","Spend_ZeroOrNegativeAmount_DoesNotRaiseCastDenied (regression-only)","PlayerManaUI_FlashesDeniedColor_OnCastDenied_ThenRevertsAfterDuration (VAL-002/VAL-003)","PlayerManaUI_DoesNotFlash_OnSuccessfulSpend (regression-only)","PlayerMana_PublicApiSurface_OnlyOwnsManaAndRegenDelayState (AC-003, regression-only ownership-boundary invariant)"],"blockers":[],"known_limitations":["ResetMana_ClearsPostCastRegenDelayTimerState uses reflection on the private `timeSinceLastSpend` field because ResetMana always also sets CurrentMana to MaxMana, and Tick() short-circuits whenever CurrentMana >= MaxMana, so the timer-clearing half of AC-001 has no observable effect through the public Spend/Tick/CurrentMana surface alone; this mirrors the project's existing reflection-based private-member test pattern in the Editor test suite but is tied to the current field name.","PlayerManaUI tests wire the private `mana`/`fillImage`/`deniedFlashDuration` serialized fields via reflection (no public setters exist) and toggle `enabled` off/on so OnEnable re-subscribes to CastDenied with the correct mana reference, since the initial AddComponent-triggered OnEnable runs before the fields are set.","PlayerMana_PublicApiSurface_OnlyOwnsManaAndRegenDelayState (AC-003) is a regression-only public-surface lock; it cannot prove no private spell-local state was ever added to PlayerMana, only that its public contract has not grown to expose such state.","No Unity Editor, compiler, or test runner was executed; compilation and pass/fail status are unverified by me and require an actual Unity Test Runner run plus human Play Mode/visual confirmation of the mana-denied flash readability."],"proposed_unity_test_scope":"Run the Unity Test Runner in Play Mode against the NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests assembly (filter: NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests.PlayerManaPlayModeTests) on a clean working tree, capture the XML result (total/passed/failed/skipped), and recheck `git status`/`git diff` afterward to confirm the non-mutation invariant held; a human should also visually confirm in Play Mode that the mana bar's red flash on a denied Force Wave/Fireball cast reads clearly as low-mana failure feedback per GDD §3."},"ttft_ms":1487,"ttft_stream_ms":917,"time_to_request_ms":28,"type":"result","duration_ms":267056,"uuid":"89fa3cff-467e-4832-98bf-da23f59698b9"}
